{
  "info": {
    "name": "eric-api \u2014 SOL-503",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "ESt (annual income tax) submission against the eric-api.\n\nStart the service:  docker compose up -d\n\nThe XML in these requests is a COMPLETE return that ERiC validates\nsuccessfully (rc=0). Every request carries Testmerker 700000004, so\nnothing reaches the Finanzamt.\n\nThe /validate requests need no certificate. The /submit requests need\ncert_base64 and cert_password set as collection variables."
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000"
    },
    {
      "key": "cert_base64",
      "value": "<base64 of your .pfx>"
    },
    {
      "key": "cert_password",
      "value": "<certificate PIN>"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "health"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Expect 200 {\"status\":\"ok\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Validate a real ESt return (auto-detect)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/validate",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "validate"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"xml\": \"<?xml version=\\\"1.0\\\" encoding=\\\"UTF-8\\\"?>\\n<Elster xmlns=\\\"http://www.elster.de/elsterxml/schema/v11\\\">\\n  <TransferHeader version=\\\"11\\\">\\n    <Verfahren>ElsterErklaerung</Verfahren>\\n    <DatenArt>ESt</DatenArt>\\n    <Vorgang>send-Auth</Vorgang>\\n    <Testmerker>700000004</Testmerker>\\n    <HerstellerID>97263</HerstellerID>\\n    <DatenLieferant>Solobooks Test</DatenLieferant>\\n    <Datei>\\n      <Verschluesselung>CMSEncryptedData</Verschluesselung>\\n      <Kompression>GZIP</Kompression>\\n      <TransportSchluessel/>\\n    </Datei>\\n  </TransferHeader>\\n  <DatenTeil>\\n    <Nutzdatenblock>\\n      <NutzdatenHeader version=\\\"11\\\">\\n        <NutzdatenTicket>1</NutzdatenTicket>\\n        <Empfaenger id=\\\"F\\\">1096</Empfaenger>\\n      </NutzdatenHeader>\\n      <Nutzdaten>\\n        <E10 xmlns=\\\"http://finkonsens.de/elster/elstererklaerung/est/e10/v2025\\\" version=\\\"2025\\\">\\n          <ESt1A>\\n            <Art_Erkl>\\n              <E0100001>X</E0100001>\\n            </Art_Erkl>\\n            <Finanzamt>\\n              <E0100006>1096</E0100006>\\n            </Finanzamt>\\n            <Allg>\\n              <A>\\n                <E0100401>01.01.1985</E0100401>\\n                <E0100201>Mustermann</E0100201>\\n                <E0100301>Max</E0100301>\\n                <E0100402>11</E0100402>\\n                <E0101104>Musterstrasse</E0101104>\\n                <E0101206>1</E0101206>\\n                <E0100601>10115</E0100601>\\n                <E0100602>Berlin</E0100602>\\n              </A>\\n              <BV>\\n                <E0102002>X</E0102002>\\n              </BV>\\n            </Allg>\\n          </ESt1A>\\n          <S>\\n            <Person>PersonA</Person>\\n            <Gewinn>\\n              <Freiber_T>\\n                <E0803101>Softwareentwicklung</E0803101>\\n                <E0803202>24500</E0803202>\\n              </Freiber_T>\\n            </Gewinn>\\n          </S>\\n          <Vorsatz>\\n            <Unterfallart>10</Unterfallart>\\n            <Vorgang>01</Vorgang>\\n            <StNr>1096081508152</StNr>\\n            <Zeitraum>2025</Zeitraum>\\n            <AbsName>Max Mustermann</AbsName>\\n            <AbsStr>Musterstr. 1</AbsStr>\\n            <AbsPlz>10115</AbsPlz>\\n            <AbsOrt>Berlin</AbsOrt>\\n            <Copyright>Solobooks</Copyright>\\n            <OrdNrArt>S</OrdNrArt>\\n            <Rueckuebermittlung>\\n              <Bescheid>1</Bescheid>\\n              <ArtRueckuebermittlung>INTERNET</ArtRueckuebermittlung>\\n            </Rueckuebermittlung>\\n          </Vorsatz>\\n        </E10>\\n      </Nutzdaten>\\n    </Nutzdatenblock>\\n  </DatenTeil>\\n</Elster>\\n\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "A COMPLETE, ERiC-VALID 2025 income tax return.\n\nNo datenartversion passed - it is detected from the E10 namespace.\nExpect 200 with \"valid\": true and <Erfolg/> in validation_result.\n\nSingle filer, freelance software developer, 24.500 EUR profit,\ntest Finanzamt 1096, Steuernummer 1096081508152."
      }
    },
